title: Global shell › Top bar › Notifications › What creates a notification
route: Every page (the bell)
intro: A notification is created only when a person or a demo control does something. Nothing arrives on a timer. The one exception is the demo clock: moving it past a patient's re-check time makes Verify re-check them. Each row below is one action, the notification it adds and the page that notification opens.
dir: LR
also: Each notification is added at the top, unread, stamped with the demo clock ('just now'). Most also raise a toast, shown in 'Toasts'.
---
start s1 "A person or a demo control does something in the app"

group gPay "Payers"
  click c10 "Click 'Update drafts' on a payer's change\n(after 'Acknowledge change', which only raises a toast)"
  store n10 "The change's agent or Scribe · 'Drafts updated'\n→ Case Manager"
endgroup

group gRef "Referrals (New case)"
  click c9 "Click 'Use sample referral'\n(or drop referral documents)"
  store n9 "Reader · 'New referral read'\n→ that referral"
  click c9b "'Demo: simulate the referrer's reply'"
  store n9b "Reader · 'The referrer replied'\n→ that referral"
endgroup

group gDen "Denial Intelligence"
  click c8 "Click 'Analyze the denial' on an uploaded letter"
  store n8 "Advocate · 'Denial analyzed'\n→ that denial"
  click c8b "Sign and file an appeal"
  store n8b "Navigator · 'Appeal filed'\n→ Dashboard, that request"
  click c8c "Click 'Accept and close'"
  store n8c "Cadence · 'Denial closed'\n→ Case Manager, Reviews this week"
  click c8d "Click 'Log the outcome'"
  store n8d "Advocate · 'Call outcome: ...'\n→ Dashboard, that request"
endgroup

group gElig "Eligibility & Benefits"
  click c11 "Demo menu, 'Fast-forward 1 hour' or 'Fast-forward 1 day', past a patient's re-check time\nOr resume Verify in Settings after a pause"
  store n11 "Verify · 'Re-checked automatically' or 'Re-checked N patients automatically'\n→ Eligibility & Benefits, that patient or the list\nNot while Verify is paused"
endgroup

group gAuth "Authorizations"
  click c7 "Apply recommendations on a case\n(Actions tab)"
  store n7 "Forecaster · 'Approval chance updated'\n→ that case"
endgroup

group gDash "Dashboard › Demo controls on a request"
  click c4 "'Asks for information'"
  store n4 "Packet · 'Payer asked for info'\n→ Dashboard, that request"
  click c5 "'Approves'"
  store n5 "Cadence · 'Approved'\n→ Dashboard, that request"
  click c6 "'Approves part' or 'Denies'"
  store n6 "Advocate · 'Partly approved' or 'Denied'\n→ Denial Intelligence, new D- number"
endgroup

group gSend "New case"
  click c1 "Click 'Sign and send'"
  store n1 "Navigator · 'Sent to the payer'\n→ Dashboard, that request"
endgroup

process p1 "Notification is added at the top of the list\nUnread, 'just now'"
process p2 "Red dot appears on the bell\nDrawer subtitle counts it ('5 unread')"
goto g1 "Continues in: Global shell › Top bar › Notifications › Open, read, click through"
endx e1 "Nothing else creates one: no timers, no payer or referrer replies on their own"

s1 --> c1 & c4 & c5 & c6 & c7 & c8 & c8b & c8c & c8d & c9 & c9b & c10 & c11
c1 --> n1
c4 --> n4
c5 --> n5
c6 --> n6
c7 --> n7
c8 --> n8
c8b --> n8b
c8c --> n8c
c8d --> n8d
c9 --> n9
c9b --> n9b
c10 --> n10
c11 --> n11
n1 & n4 & n5 & n6 & n7 & n8 & n8b & n8c & n8d & n9 & n9b & n10 & n11 --> p1
p1 --> p2 --> g1
s1 -.-> e1
